menuconfig SOUND
    bool "Sound support"
    default y

if SOUND
config SND
    tristate "ALSA and OSS sound core"
    default y
    help
      Linux-compatible ALSA/OSS character interfaces, card registry, PCM,
      control/mixer/timer operations and provider-owned user mappings.
      With M, build snd.ko for this exact ReliefNT kernel. Native hardware
      driver dependencies load it first. Open files, mapped PCM backing,
      registered cards and deferred disconnect work prevent unsafe unload.
endif
